 Saxon, Stefanie Powers.","c":["Science fiction","Series","Drama"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/680bab8730b839eca55aed79/tile_1745595279014.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"20261129011600 +0000"},{"s":1795918320,"e":1795921740,"t":"Bionic Woman","st":"Assault on the Princess","d":"Jaime deals blackjack aboard a floating casino carrying unstable, explosive energy-cell prototypes.","c":["Science fiction","Series","Drama"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/680bab8730b839eca55aed79/tile_1745595279014.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"20261129021200 +0000"},{"s":1795921740,"e":1795925100,"t":"Bionic Woman","st":"In This Corner, Jaime Sommers","d":"Jaime competes as a professional lady wrestler while searching for a missing OSI agent.","c":["Science fiction","Series","Drama"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/680bab8730b839eca55aed79/tile_1745595279014.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"20261129030900 +0000"}]